# AnimateShader — English Localization

profile.PERFORMANCE=Performance
profile.BALANCED=Balanced Fantasy (Recommended)
profile.FANTASY_ULTRA=Fantasy Ultra
profile.comment=Quick quality presets: Performance for lightweight GPUs; Balanced Fantasy for rich anime visuals & smooth FPS; Fantasy Ultra for maximum cloud, shadow, and reflection fidelity.

screen.LIGHTING=Lighting & Brightness Balance
screen.COLOR=Color Expression & Grading
screen.GLOW_EFFECTS=Dazzling Effects & Bloom
screen.SKY_CLOUDS=Fantasy Sky & Clouds
screen.WATER_WORLD=Water & Living World
screen.SHADOWS=Shadows

option.NIGHT_BRIGHTNESS=Night Brightness
option.NIGHT_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Controls moonlight and starry night ambient brightness. Default 1.35 keeps nights luminous, vivid, and never pitch black.

option.CAVE_BRIGHTNESS=Cave / Indoor Floor
option.CAVE_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Controls minimum ambient visibility inside unlit caves and interiors while preserving magical depth.

option.OVERALL_EXPOSURE=Overall Exposure Balance
option.OVERALL_EXPOSURE.comment=Fine-tunes overall brightness balance between noon highlights and cozy nights.

option.ANIME_SHADING_STYLE=Anime Shading Style
option.ANIME_SHADING_STYLE.comment=Choose diffuse ramp style: Smooth Fantasy for painterly illustration, Soft Anime Cel for Makoto Shinkai feel, Crisp Cel for bold anime bands.
value.ANIME_SHADING_STYLE.0=Smooth Fantasy
value.ANIME_SHADING_STYLE.1=Soft Anime Cel
value.ANIME_SHADING_STYLE.2=Crisp Anime Cel

option.RIM_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Anime Rim Highlight
option.RIM_LIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Adds subtle backlit golden sun-rim and silver-cyan moon-rim highlights to sunlit entities and foliage.

option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH=Block Light Strength
option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts illumination from torches, lanterns, soul lights, sea lanterns, and emissive blocks.

option.DYNAMIC_HANDLIGHT=Dynamic Handheld Light
option.DYNAMIC_HANDLIGHT.comment=Lights up nearby blocks smoothly when holding glowing items in either main hand or off-hand.

option.SSAO_ENABLED=Screen-Space AO (SSAO)
option.SSAO_ENABLED.comment=Adds subtle color-tinted contact shading in block crevices for painterly depth.

option.FOLIAGE_SSS=Foliage Subsurface Scattering
option.FOLIAGE_SSS.comment=Makes leaves, cherry blossoms, grass, and flowers glow translucently when backlit.

option.COLOR_PALETTE=Color Theme Palette
option.COLOR_PALETTE.comment=Selects the signature anime fantasy color palette for sky, sunlight, shadows, and atmosphere.
value.COLOR_PALETTE.0=Shinkai Azure
value.COLOR_PALETTE.1=Sakura Fantasy
value.COLOR_PALETTE.2=Emerald Ghibli
value.COLOR_PALETTE.3=Ethereal Violet

option.COLOR_VIBRANCE=Color Vibrance
option.COLOR_VIBRANCE.comment=Boosts natural color richness selectively without clipping already saturated hues.

option.SHADOW_COLOR_TINT=Shadow Hue Shift
option.SHADOW_COLOR_TINT.comment=Classic anime background art technique: tints shadows with luminous cerulean and lavender instead of muddy grey.

option.SUNSET_WARMTH=Sunset Richness
option.SUNSET_WARMTH.comment=Enhances vibrant tangerine, rose-magenta, and violet twilight hues during golden hour.

option.TONEMAP_CONTRAST=Tone Map Contrast
option.TONEMAP_CONTRAST.comment=Fine-tunes the anime filmic contrast curve.

option.BLOOM_ENABLED=Dreamy HDR Bloom
option.BLOOM_ENABLED.comment=Multi-scale silky HDR bloom for sun, moon, lanterns, crystals, portals, and water glints.

option.BLOOM_INTENSITY=Bloom Intensity
option.BLOOM_INTENSITY.comment=Controls the radiance of HDR bloom halos.

option.ANAMORPHIC_STREAK=Anamorphic Light Streaks
option.ANAMORPHIC_STREAK.comment=Adds cinematic horizontal anime light streaks to intense highlights and emissives.

option.GODRAYS_ENABLED=Volumetric Godrays
option.GODRAYS_ENABLED.comment=Renders luminous crepuscular sunbeams and moonbeams streaming past terrain and trees.

option.GODRAYS_STRENGTH=Godray Intensity
option.GODRAYS_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts visibility of volumetric light shafts.

option.EMISSIVE_GLOW=Emissive Block Radiance
option.EMISSIVE_GLOW.comment=Enhances colorful glow on lanterns, soul fire, amethyst, froglights, redstone, and portals.

option.SUN_LENS_FLARE=Sun / Moon Halo Flare
option.SUN_LENS_FLARE.comment=Renders delicate anime bokeh rings and starburst flares when glancing near the sun or moon.

option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH=Soft Vignette
option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH.comment=Subtle atmospheric edge framing (set to 0.0 to disable).

option.ANIME_CLOUDS=Painterly Anime Clouds
option.ANIME_CLOUDS.comment=Layered volumetric cumulus and cirrus clouds with backlit silver-gold edges and pastel undersides.

option.CLOUD_QUALITY=Cloud Quality
option.CLOUD_QUALITY.comment=Adjusts raymarching step quality for volumetric anime clouds.
value.CLOUD_QUALITY.0=Fast
value.CLOUD_QUALITY.1=Detailed
value.CLOUD_QUALITY.2=Ultra

option.FANTASY_AURORA=Fantasy Night Aurora
option.FANTASY_AURORA.comment=Shimmering emerald, cyan, violet, and sakura-pink aurora ribbons dancing across the night sky.

option.AURORA_STRENGTH=Aurora Vibrance
option.AURORA_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts brightness and richness of the fantasy night aurora.

option.MILKY_WAY=Milky Way & Starfield
option.MILKY_WAY.comment=Luminous cosmic Milky Way band and twinkling multi-colored stars at night.

option.SHOOTING_STARS=Shooting Stars
option.SHOOTING_STARS.comment=Occasional glowing meteors streaking gracefully across the starry sky.

option.ATMOSPHERIC_FOG=Aerial Perspective Mist
option.ATMOSPHERIC_FOG.comment=Soft sky-matched pastel distance haze for dreamy depth and scale.

option.WATER_SSR=Water Screen-Space Reflections
option.WATER_SSR.comment=Real-time reflections of mountains, trees, builds, and glowing lights on water and ice.

option.WATER_CAUSTICS=Underwater Caustics
option.WATER_CAUSTICS.comment=Animated sparkling sun/moon caustic patterns projected onto submerged surfaces.

option.WATER_SPARKLES=Anime Water Sparkles
option.WATER_SPARKLES.comment=Twinkling star-like specular glints dancing on sunlit and moonlit wave crests.

option.WATER_CLARITY=Crystal Water Clarity
option.WATER_CLARITY.comment=Adjusts shallow aquamarine to deep sapphire water transparency.

option.WAVING_FOLIAGE=Waving Foliage
option.WAVING_FOLIAGE.comment=Gentle wind sway on leaves, cherry blossoms, grass, flowers, and crops (synced with shadows).

option.WET_REFLECTIONS=Wet Rain Reflections
option.WET_REFLECTIONS.comment=Adds luminous wet specular sheen and puddles during rain without darkening the world.

option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Shadow map texture resolution. 2048 balances sharpness and performance.

option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=Maximum real-time shadow rendering radius in blocks.

option.SHADOW_QUALITY=Soft Shadow Quality
option.SHADOW_QUALITY.comment=Controls Vogel-disk PCF shadow filtering sample count.
value.SHADOW_QUALITY.0=Fast
value.SHADOW_QUALITY.1=Soft
value.SHADOW_QUALITY.2=Smooth

option.COLORED_SHADOWS=Colored Stained-Glass Shadows
option.COLORED_SHADOWS.comment=Projects vibrant colored light onto floors and walls when sunlight shines through stained glass.

option.NIGHT_SHADOWS=Soft Moonlight Shadows
option.NIGHT_SHADOWS.comment=Enables gentle moonlight shadows at night while keeping shadowed areas bright and colorful.
